  "body": "Lot 13 | 33 Anehana Place, Stanmore Bay\r\n\r\nBuild your dream home on this generous 642m² flat section, positioned to capture beautiful sea views and sunsets over the bay.\r\n\r\nPlans are available for a spacious, two-level, five-bedroom home, — giving you a valuable head start on your building journey.\r\n\r\n• Private sale — deal directly with the owner\r\n\r\nThe upcoming Penlink connection will provide a new route between the Whangaparaoa Peninsula and SH1 at Redvale, adding to the appeal of this coastal location.",
